      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To initiate the computer repair process, begin by examining the hardware."
      ],
      "justification": "The opening clause implicitly signals the process start and explicitly describes the initial hardware examination step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the hardware has been checked, proceed with repairing any issues that were identified."
